Description:
 gir1.2-nm-1.0 - GObject introspection data for the libnm library
 libnm-dev  - GObject-based client library for NetworkManager (development file
 libnm0     - GObject-based client library for NetworkManager
 network-manager - network management framework (daemon and userspace tools)
 network-manager-config-connectivity-debian - NetworkManager configuration to enable connectivity checking
 network-manager-dev - network management framework (development files)
 network-manager-l10n - network management framework (translation files)
 network-manager-ovs - Open vSwitch device plugin for NetworkManager
 network-manager-team - Team device plugin for NetworkManager
 network-manager-tui - NetworkManager curses-based UI
Changes:
 network-manager (1.58.1-1+crquickshare1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
 .
   * Add an opt-in autonomous Wi-Fi Direct GO connection mode using the
     wpa_supplicant backend and the standard NetworkManager activation lifecycle.
   * Add an authorized group credential API and downstream libnm bindings.
